  "notes": "{語|かた}る means to tell, narrate, or recount. It has a more literary, formal tone than ⟦{話|はな}す→話す：00467_hanasu⟧.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{語|かた}る / X⟦について→〜について：03103_nitsuite⟧{語|かた}る\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{語|かた}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means 'is telling/narrating' (ongoing action) or 'tells us' (a fact that speaks for itself, e.g., ⟦{歴史|れきし}→歴史：02267_rekishi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{語|かた}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{話|はな}す→話す：00467_hanasu⟧: to speak, talk (everyday, casual)\n- {語|かた}る: to narrate, tell (literary, for stories and experiences)\n- ⟦{述|の}べる→述べる：02389_noberu⟧: to state (formal, factual)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{経験|けいけん}→経験：01179_keiken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{語|かた}る: to tell of one's experiences\n- ⟦{夢|ゆめ}→夢：01519_yume⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{語|かた}る: to talk about one's dreams/aspirations\n- {語|かた}り⟦{合|あ}う→合う：10466_au⟧: to talk together, to share stories with each other\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{物語|ものがたり}→物語：03634_monogatari⟧: story, tale (noun)\n- {語|かた}り: narration, storytelling",
